	(text "I2C PULL-UPS - one pair per bus, all here\n   IMU        PF0/PF1     R16/R17  4.7k  on-board\n   KICKER     PB10/PB11   R30/R31  2.2k  cabled\n   EXPANSION  PF14/PF15   R32/R33  2.2k  cabled\n   OLED       PB8/PB9     R34/R35  3k    design doc\n400kHz: t_r max 300ns, t_r = 0.8473 x Rp x Cb (TI SLVA689).\n   Cb max: 4.7k 75pF (short on-board IMU bus), 3k 118pF, 2.2k 161pF.\n   Above 161pF on a cable: see the 1.5k option note. Sink at 2.2k = 1.5mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 396.24 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "077f517e-614f-4104-8c0c-cb1f0ade16f0")
	)
