	(text "ROUTING - DECOUPLING: each cap beside the STM32 pin named under it, via straight to GND.\nC26/C27 (VCAP) tight to p71/p106. The netlist does not keep this pairing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.69 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
