		(uuid "298ea597-2a24-4450-ad6b-ffdab51334c7")
	)
	(text "ROUTING - HSE CRYSTAL\nX1, C49, C50 within 5mm of PH0/PH1.\nShort equal OSC traces, GND guard ring.\nNothing routed under or beside the loop."
