	(text "R41/R42 22R: series termination on motor SPI SCK/MOSI.\nPin ~25R + 22R ~ 50R line, so reflections from the 5 cables are\nabsorbed at the MCU (a ring on SCK = false clock edge).\nMISO has none (input). Multidrop bus: tune 0-47R on a scope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 369.57 130.81 0)
