	(text "VDDA p33 + VREF+ p32 tie directly to +3V3\n(ferrite bead dropped). C28+C29 at VDDA,\nC30+C31 at VREF+ - one pair per pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc14bd9d-a1a5-4c62-9558-d89a9ea2a0d3")
	)
	(text "OPTIONAL I2C PULL-UP CHANGE (not applied - measure first)\nR30/R31 (kicker) and R32/R33 (expansion): 2.2k -> 1.5k only if measured t_r > 300ns.\n  Fast Mode: t_r <= 300ns, Cb <= 400pF, VOL 0.4V at 3mA (TI SLVA689 Table 1).\n  t_r (0.3 to 0.7 VCC) = 0.8473 x Rp x Cb (SLVA689 eq. 5).\n  2.2k: Cb max = 300ns / (0.8473 x 2.2k) = 161pF.   1.5k: Cb max = 236pF.\n  Rp min = (3.3V - 0.4V) / 3mA = 967R (SLVA689 eq. 1), so 1.5k is legal.\n  Measure SCL at TP16/TP17 with the real cable fitted. Keep 2.2k if t_r passes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 400.05 255.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
				(color 255 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c08e1f74-f24b-4c8a-ba34-a0205dcb4ca5")
	)
	(text "ROUTING - MOTOR SPI (6 Mbit/s, 5 drops)\nR41/R42 within 5mm of PA5/PA7, not at the connectors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 356.87 153.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
				(color 255 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c4b94f7a-d944-44cd-a5ed-07052f444732")
	)
	(text "VREF+ p32 (C30+C31)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 378.46 117 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify top)
		)
		(uuid "c70d4c9a-db22-4d2b-ab37-99f244f6cf36")
	)
	(text "CLOCKING (reasoning: FIRMWARE_CONFIG.txt)\nX1 Abracon ABM8-25.000MHZ-10-B1U-T on PH0 p23 / PH1 p24. CL 10pF, ESR 50R max, C0 3pF max.\n  Crystal, not HSI48: USB FS needs +/-0.25% (USB 2.0 7.1.11); HSI48 is +/-1.04% untrimmed\n  (DS13313 Table 35). ABM8 total ~22ppm.\n  25MHz, not 48MHz: gm_crit = 4 ESR (2 pi F)^2 (C0+CL)^2 = 0.83mA/V at 25MHz, 2.15mA/V at\n  48MHz; STM32 Gmcritmax is 1.5mA/V (DS13313 Table 33).\nC49/C50 12pF C0G: (12+5)(12+5)/34 + 1-2pF PCB = 9.5-10.5pF (CIO 5pF, DS13313).\n!! CubeMX V0.3 has HSE = 48MHz. Set HSE_VALUE 25000000, PLL1 M/5 N x96 P/2 Q/10:\n   5MHz PLL in (2-16), VCO 480 (192-836, Table 39) -> SYSCLK 240MHz, PLL1Q 48MHz\n   for USB, SDMMC1, SPI1-3.\nDIP4 = PC0 (p26), DIP5 = PC1 (p27); PF5/PF6 unused. No LSE: PC14 = USER_EXTI2.\n\nSUPPLY PINS\nVDDA (p33) and VREF+ (p32) on +3V3, no ferrite (same as Nucleo).\nC28+C29 at VDDA, C30+C31 at VREF+.\nPDR_ON (p143) = +3V3, internal reset on. VBAT (p6) = +3V3, no battery.\nVCAP1/VCAP2 (p71/p106): C26/C27 2.2uF X7R, ESR under 100m, each to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 47.24 226.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d4cdf7f0-1d06-4985-b511-312e99861993")
	)
