		(property "Description" "22R series termination on MOTOR_SPI_SCK (PA5). Pin ~25R + 22R ~ 50R trace impedance, so edge reflections from the 5 motor cables are absorbed at the source instead of ringing back (a ring on SCK = false clock edge). Must sit within 5mm of PA5. Tune 0-47R on a scope (multidrop bus)."
			(at 360.68 138.43 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
