		(property "Description" "PA15 pull-up. AN2606 Table 111: the H72x ROM bootloader runs SPI3 as a slave on PC10/PC11/PC12 (our SD DAT2/DAT3/CLK) with NSS on PA15 'no pull'. Holding NSS high keeps SPI3 deselected so SD activity cannot take the bootloader away from USB DFU."
